# ─── Databases ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite databases are ignored by default...
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ...except the seeded analytical database, which is COMMITTED ON PURPOSE.
# It is the project's only copy of the ~17,200 cleaned CIHI rows: schema.sql
# creates the tables but leaves them empty, and load_csv.py cannot refill them
# (it reads data/optimized/, which does not exist). Deleting this file leaves
# every dashboard, hypothesis test, and chart with no data.
# See README.md → "Database & Data Provenance".
!backend/database/healthcare.db

